# Phase 3 fit artifacts (Plan 03-07).
#
# Per-run fit_report.json + residuals.parquet artifacts re-materialize
# deterministically from the Phase-2 panel (run_id = sha256 of panel +
# code + tick version, per CONTEXT.md). Only the manifest is committed.
# Mirrors the data/raw/.gitignore allowlist pattern from Phase 2.

*
!.gitignore
!manifest.json

# Phase 5 REPORT-04 (Option C-hybrid): the canonical Iteration-1 run dir bdaf5c7ba5a2
# is committed as reproducibility evidence (<50KB total). scipy MLE is not
# byte-reproducible across BLAS, so verify-reproducibility checksums these
# committed files rather than re-fitting. Directory-spanning allowlist: re-include
# the dir chain, re-ignore the dir contents, then negate the kept artifacts.
!ichi/
ichi/*
!ichi/bdaf5c7ba5a2/
ichi/bdaf5c7ba5a2/*
!ichi/bdaf5c7ba5a2/*.json
!ichi/bdaf5c7ba5a2/*.parquet
!ichi/bdaf5c7ba5a2/*.md
!ichi/bdaf5c7ba5a2/*.txt
